fter one  point two four we can start writing 0 1  0 0 1 0 0 0 1 and so on  that's one irrational number between  these two numbers again let's write 1  point 2 4 and this time we write 0 2 0 0  2 0 0 0 2 and so on after it that's your  second irrational number  so to find irrational numbers between  two numbers just write a rational number  between them and then add nonterminating  non-repeating digits after it
 

